{
  "key": 18215,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_DawnTheProfessorIsWaiting",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Oh! There you are!\n",
        "Please, come with me!\f",
        "The professor is waiting!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Oh! Te voilà!\n",
        "Viens avec moi, s’il te plaît!\f",
        "Le professeur nous attend!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_DawnThisIsItOurLab",
      "en_US": [
        "This is it!\n",
        "Our Pokémon Research Lab!\r",
        "Let’s go...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Nous y voici!\n",
        "Notre Labo Pokémon!\r",
        "Allons-y...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_LucasTheProfsWaitingToSeeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hi! I’ve been waiting for you!\n",
        "Please, come with me.\f",
        "The prof’s waiting to see you.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Salut! Je t’attendais!\n",
        "Suis-moi, s’il te plaît.\f",
        "Le professeur t’attend.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_LucasThisIsItOurLab",
      "en_US": [
        "See? This is our Pokémon Research\n",
        "Lab.\r",
        "We’ll just go ahead and...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu vois? C’est notre Labo Pokémon.\r",
        "On va entrer et...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_BigThud",
      "en_US": "{SIZE 200}Thud!!{SIZE 100}\r",
      "fr_FR": "{SIZE 200}Boum!!!{SIZE 100}\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_OhItsYouPlayer",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What the...\r",
        "Oh, it’s you, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "That old guy... He’s not scary so\n",
        "much as he is totally out there!\r",
        "Aww, it doesn’t matter, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "I’m out of here. See you later!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Mais que...\r",
        "Oh, c’est toi, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Ce vieil homme... Il est encore plus fou\n",
        "qu’effrayant!\r",
        "Bah, ce n’est pas grave, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "Je m’en vais. A plus!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_DawnLetsGoInside",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Wow, what was that?\r",
        "Your friend sure seems to be really\n",
        "impatient.\r",
        "Well, anyway...\n",
        "Let’s go inside.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: C’était quoi, ça?\r",
        "Ton ami a vraiment l’air impatient.\r",
        "Bon, enfin...\n",
        "Entrons.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_LucasLetsGoIn",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: What was that?!\r",
        "Your friend always seems to be\n",
        "in such a rush.\r",
        "Anyway...\n",
        "Let’s go in.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: C’était quoi, ça?!\r",
        "Ton ami a toujours l’air tellement\n",
        "pressé.\r",
        "Peu importe...\n",
        "Entrons.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_BigPlayer",
      "en_US": "{SIZE 200}{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!{SIZE 100}\r",
      "fr_FR": "{SIZE 200}{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!{SIZE 100}\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_TakeThisAsWell",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: I have something good here.\n",
        "You should take this as well.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: J’ai quelque chose d’utile\n",
        "pour toi. Prends.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_ContainsTheMoveReturn",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: That is a Technical Machine.\n",
        "That one contains the move Return.\r",
        "Using a Technical Machine, or TM for\n",
        "short, teaches a move instantly to\f",
        "a Pokémon.\r",
        "Bear in mind, however, that a TM is\n",
        "single-use only.\r",
        "The move Return gains power the more\n",
        "friendly your Pokémon is with you.\r",
        "It’s up to you, of course, if you want\n",
        "to use that TM or not.\r",
        "I’ll send you off with the wish that\n",
        "your journey will be fun.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: C’est une Capsule Technique.\n",
        "Elle contient la capacité Retour.\r",
        "Les Capsules Techniques, ou CT, te\n",
        "permettent d’enseigner instantanément\f",
        "une capacité à un Pokémon.\r",
        "Cela dit, elles ne sont utilisables\n",
        "qu’une fois.\r",
        "L’efficacité de la capacité Retour\n",
        "est proportionnelle à l’amitié que\f",
        "ton Pokémon a pour toi.\r",
        "A toi de décider si tu veux l’utiliser\n",
        "ou non.\r",
        "Sur ce, je te souhaite bon voyage.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_DawnIDidntKnowProfessorHadTMs",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Oh, wow.\n",
        "I didn’t know the professor had TMs.\r",
        "Was he a Trainer when he was\n",
        "young...?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Waouh! J’ignorais que\n",
        "le professeur avait des CT.\r",
        "Etait-il Dresseur quand\n",
        "il était jeune...?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_LucasWellIllBeProfessorHadTMs",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Well, I’ll be...\n",
        "The professor had TMs...?\r",
        "Next thing, he’ll tell me he battled\n",
        "when he was young.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: J’y crois pas...\n",
        "Le professeur a des CT...?\r",
        "On en apprend de belles! Si ça se\n",
        "trouve, il était Dresseur, avant.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_DawnIllActAsYourMentor",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, I’ll act as\n",
        "your mentor.\r",
        "I’ve got a bit more experience than\n",
        "you as a Trainer and as the professor’s\f",
        "assistant.\r",
        "OK, follow me!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "OK, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, je vais te servir\n",
        "de mentor.\r",
        "J’ai un peu plus d’expérience que toi\n",
        "en tant que Dresseur et assistante\f",
        "du professeur.\r",
        "Suis-moi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_DawnThisIsThePokemonCenter",
      "en_US": [
        "This building with the red roof is\n",
        "the Pokémon Center.\r",
        "It’s the place that heals Pokémon\n",
        "that have been hurt in battle.\r",
        "You can find a Pokémon Center in\n",
        "most towns.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce bâtiment avec le toit rouge est le\n",
        "Centre Pokémon.\r",
        "C’est l’endroit où on peut soigner les\n",
        "Pokémon qui ont été blessés au combat.\r",
        "Tu peux trouver un Centre Pokémon\n",
        "dans la plupart des villes.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_DawnThisIsThePokeMart",
      "en_US": [
        "The building with the blue roof over\n",
        "here is the Poké Mart.\r",
        "It’s a shop where you can buy and\n",
        "sell items and medicine.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, since you’re a novice\n",
        "Trainer, you won’t be able to buy\f",
        "many kinds of merchandise.\r",
        "Don’t let it bother you!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le bâtiment avec le toit bleu que tu\n",
        "vois ici est la Boutique Pokémon.\r",
        "C’est un magasin où tu peux acheter et\n",
        "vendre des objets ainsi que des soins.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, puisque tu débutes\n",
        "comme Dresseur, tu ne pourras acheter\f",
        "que quelques types de produits.\r",
        "Ne t’en préoccupe pas!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_DawnLetYourFamilyKnow",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, that’s right!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\r",
        "Don’t you need to let your family\n",
        "know that you’re going to be helping\f",
        "Prof. Rowan with the Pokédex?\r",
        "You may need to go far away, so I\n",
        "think you should let someone know.\r",
        "Oh, but before you go, heal up your\n",
        "Pokémon at the Pokémon Center.\r",
        "It will be a lot less scary that way.\n",
        "OK, bye now!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, c’est vrai, j’oubliais!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\r",
        "Il faudrait que tu préviennes ta famille\n",
        "que tu vas aider le Professeur Sorbier\f",
        "avec le Pokédex!\r",
        "Tu vas peut-être devoir partir loin,\n",
        "alors tu devrais prévenir quelqu’un.\r",
        "Oh, mais avant de partir, soigne ton\n",
        "Pokémon au Centre Pokémon.\r",
        "Ça sera beaucoup moins risqué ainsi.\n",
        "OK, allez, au revoir!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_LucasShowYouAFewThings",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "I want to show you a few things.\f",
        "So, follow me!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "J’ai quelques trucs à te montrer.\f",
        "Suis-moi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_LucasThisIsThePokemonCenter",
      "en_US": [
        "This building with the red roof is\n",
        "the Pokémon Center.\r",
        "You can get your Pokémon healed if\n",
        "it’s been hurt in battle.\r",
        "You’ll find a Pokémon Center in most\n",
        "towns.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce bâtiment avec le toit rouge est le\n",
        "Centre Pokémon.\r",
        "Tu peux y soigner tes Pokémon qui\n",
        "ont été blessés au combat.\r",
        "Tu peux trouver un Centre Pokémon\n",
        "dans la plupart des villes.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_LucasThisIsThePokeMart",
      "en_US": [
        "Over here, the building with the blue\n",
        "roof is the Poké Mart.\r",
        "It’s a shop where you can buy and\n",
        "sell all sorts of items.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, since you’re a rookie\n",
        "Trainer, you won’t be able to buy\f",
        "very much stuff.\r",
        "Don’t worry about it, OK?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Par là, le bâtiment avec le toit bleu est\n",
        "la Boutique Pokémon.\r",
        "C’est un magasin où tu peux acheter et\n",
        "vendre toutes sortes d’objets.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, puisque tu es un\n",
        "Dresseur débutant, tu ne peux pas\f",
        "acheter grand-chose.\r",
        "Ne t’inquiète pas pour ça, OK?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_LucasLetYourFamilyKnow",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, yeah, right!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\r",
        "You should let your family know\n",
        "you’re helping Prof. Rowan put\f",
        "together his Pokédex.\r",
        "Sometimes, you have to go far away,\n",
        "so you should let someone know.\r",
        "Oh, but first, go heal up your\n",
        "Pokémon at the Pokémon Center.\r",
        "You’ll be safe then.\n",
        "OK, be seeing you!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, oui, j’oubliais!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\r",
        "Tu devrais prévenir ta famille que tu\n",
        "vas aider le Professeur Sorbier à\f",
        "compléter son Pokédex.\r",
        "Parfois, on doit partir loin, mais il faut\n",
        "toujours prévenir sa famille.\r",
        "Oh, mais d’abord, va soigner ton\n",
        "Pokémon au Centre Pokémon.\r",
        "C’est plus sûr comme ça.\n",
        "OK, à plus tard!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_PokemonAreSoCool",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow!\n",
        "Pokémon are so cool!\r",
        "You can make yours battle and make\n",
        "them stronger!\r",
        "I wish I had some!\n",
        "It’s so cool!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, waouh!\n",
        "Les Pokémon sont si cool!\r",
        "Tu peux faire combattre les tiens et\n",
        "les rendre plus forts!\r",
        "J’aimerais tellement en avoir!\n",
        "Ils sont trop cool!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_ItsAPokedexIsntIt",
      "en_US": [
        "That thing you have!\r",
        "It’s a Pokédex, isn’t it?!\r",
        "You’re off to see all kinds of\n",
        "Pokémon now! Lucky you!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce truc que tu as là!\r",
        "C’est un Pokédex, pas vrai?\r",
        "Tu es en route pour voir toutes sortes\n",
        "de Pokémon! Quelle chance tu as!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_IdBetterSaveThis",
      "en_US": [
        "So I don’t forget what’s happened,\n",
        "till now, I’d better save this...\r",
        "There!\n",
        "Now I can take a break."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pour ne pas oublier ce qui s’est passé\n",
        "jusque-là, je devrais sauvegarder...\r",
        "Ça y est!\n",
        "Maintenant, je peux faire une pause."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_RowansComeBack",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Rowan’s come back to town!\r",
        "It must be, like, four years since\n",
        "he left.\r",
        "They say he was doing his research\n",
        "somewhere else all this time."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le Professeur Sorbier est de retour!\r",
        "Ça doit faire plusieurs années qu’il\n",
        "est parti.\r",
        "On dit qu’il conduisait ses recherches\n",
        "ailleurs pendant tout ce temps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_MapSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Sandgem Town\n",
        "Town of Sand!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Littorella\n",
        "Ville du sable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_SignPokemonResearchLab",
      "en_US": "Pokémon Research Lab",
      "fr_FR": "Labo Pokémon"
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_SignCounterpartsHouse",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s House",
      "fr_FR": "Chez {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_SignPokeMart",
      "en_US": [
        "All Your Item Needs Fulfilled!\n",
        "Pokémon Mart"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Boutique Pokémon\n",
        "Faites le plein d’objets!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTown_Text_SignPokemonCenter",
      "en_US": [
        "Heal Your Pokémon!\n",
        "Pokémon Center"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Centre Pokémon\n",
        "Soignez vos Pokémon!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}